fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/GstAnalyticsModelInfo.html#gst_analytics_modelinfo_get_id","fragment":"\n\tgst_analytics_modelinfo_get_id\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.prototype.get_id\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo.get_id\n\nGet the tensor ID from the modelinfo for the specified tensor name.\nThe tensor ID is ideally registered in the Tensor ID Registry.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalyticsModelInfo\nThe name of the tensor\nThe tensor ID string, or NULL if not found.\nThe caller must free this with g_free when done.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nGet the tensor ID from the modelinfo for the specified tensor name.\nThe tensor ID is ideally registered in the Tensor ID Registry.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalytics.ModelInfo\nThe name of the tensor\nThe tensor ID string, or null if not found.\nThe caller must free this with GLib.prototype.free when done.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nGet the tensor ID from the modelinfo for the specified tensor name.\nThe tensor ID is ideally registered in the Tensor ID Registry.\nParameters:\nInstance of GstAnalytics.ModelInfo\nThe name of the tensor\nThe tensor ID string, or None if not found.\nThe caller must free this with GLib.free when done.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});